## Output Format

When issues are found, report using this structure:

```
## Code Quality Review — [scope summary]

### Critical (must fix)
- [file:line] — description

### Important (should fix)
- [file:line] — description

### Minor (consider)
- [file:line] — description
```

If no issues are found, produce **no output**.
